Task 4 – One-Day Trip to Ahmedabad

Objective

The objective is to use a structured planning prompt to generate a
one-day itinerary for Ahmedabad. The plan should include travel, food,
and entertainment while keeping the day practical.

Prompt Used

Plan a one-day trip to Ahmedabad for a first-time visitor. Create a
practical itinerary from morning to night that includes sightseeing,
local food, travel between places, and entertainment. Include a mix of
cultural places and relaxed activities. For each part of the day, give
an approximate time, place, suggested activity, travel suggestion, and a
food option. Keep the route reasonably practical so that the traveler
does not spend most of the day commuting. Assume the traveler wants a
moderate budget and prefers local Gujarati food along with one relaxed
evening activity. Present the plan in chronological order and include a
short list of useful travel tips at the end.

Detailed Sample AI Response

Useful Travel Tips

Start early so that the day does not become rushed.

Keep some flexibility because traffic and attraction timings can affect
the schedule.

Use app-based cabs or autos for locations that are not convenient to
reach by walking.

Carry water and comfortable footwear because the itinerary includes
walking.

Check current opening hours, entry rules and traffic conditions before
leaving.

The itinerary is a sample planning response. Attraction timings,
traffic, prices and availability can change, so they should be checked
before an actual trip.